# Dependencies
node_modules/

# Build output (Vite/Web)
dist/
build/
*.d

# Tauri generated & bundled resources
src-tauri/gen/
src-tauri/target/
# NOT src-tauri/icons/ — tauri::generate_context!() reads them at compile time,
# so ignoring them means the crate does not build from a clean checkout.

# Rust build (same as src-tauri/target/ but kept for any Cargo workspace root)
target/

# Generated API references. `npm run docs` writes docs/ts/ (Doxygen), `cargo doc`
# writes target/doc, and the Docs workflow assembles both into site/ for Pages.
# None of it is source; Pages serves the artefact the workflow builds, not a
# committed copy.
docs/
site/

# Environment
.env
.env.*

# IDE / OS
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

*.dot

# LLM 
.claude/
handoff.md
newHandoff.md
# Numbered session handoffs, now under handoff/ (Handoff-01.md … + INDEX.md).
# The bare pattern stays for any stray file left at the repo root.
handoff/
Handoff-*.md
repomix-output.md
pattern1.md
CLAUDE.md
Handoff.md
coverage/
